stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Bound
    Bound --> Evidence : current execution / source / incarnation
    Evidence --> Evidence : Running, Unknown, old Stop, compact SessionStart
    Evidence --> DraftAdmission : matching first SessionStart or completed-turn Idle
    DraftAdmission --> TypedHeld : existing composer veto before first key
    TypedHeld --> Evidence : same NotSentProof / hold_not_sent / wake
    DraftAdmission --> FirstKey : proof revalidated; existing writer gate
    FirstKey --> Receipt : existing payload and Enter
    Receipt --> Done : exact original receipt
    Receipt --> RetainedUnknown : existing crash contract
    Bound --> ReverseExit : existing reverse return path; outside this readiness refinement
